eam. I verified the tests are not vacuous with four negative controls (mutating `memset(m,0,mlen)`→0, `xor_buf(...,8)`→7, secretbox's `for i in 0..16` zeroing loop, etc.) — each was caught by the expected test(s), and all mutations were reverted (final green run is against unmodified sources).\n\n**Important harness caveat other agents need to know:** `cargo test --target-dir $W/_t/<AREA>` does **not** build the cdylib into that directory — cargo only produces the rlib for test linking. `tests/common/mod.rs` then silently falls back to `translation/target/release/liblibsodium.so`, which is shared by all parallel agents and can be stale or contain someone else's in-progress edits. My first \"18 passed\" run was against that stale library and would have passed even with a deliberately broken module. The fix is to always run `cargo build --release --offline --target-dir $W/_t/<AREA>` **before** `cargo test --target-dir $W/_t/<AREA>`.\n\n**Not verified / notes**\n- 4 `sodium_misuse()` paths (`mlen > MESSAGEBYTES_MAX` in the 3 combined AEAD `encrypt`s, `secretbox_easy`, `secretbox_xchacha20poly1305_easy`, `secretstream_push`) and `secretstream_pull`'s `mlen > MESSAGEBYTES_MAX` abort in-process and require ≥256 GiB inputs; verified by inspection that the Rust calls `sodium_misuse()` at the same point (and that `push` sets `*outlen_p = 0` before it).\n- `crypto_secretstream_..._pull` with `m == NULL` is not supported by the C (it passes `m` straight to `chacha20_ietf_xor_ic`); marked `[n/a]`.\n- `ACQUIRE_FENCE` is absent from the Rust; confirmed correct — with no `HAVE_*` macros it expands to `(void) 0` (`include/sodium/private/common.h:295`).\n- `*_keygen()` and `init_push()` are randomized; I made them fully comparable by installing a deterministic `randombytes_implementation` into both `.so`s via `randombytes_set_implementation()` (which unconditionally replaces the pointer in this build), and additionally cross-checked `init_push`'s state against `init_pull` of the same header."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":632,"cache_read_input_tokens":188513,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":632,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01UA4mXwNQXmScfm2RaLPYfv","session_id":"f6aed658-f045-47ac-a150-aec5e315d5dc","uuid":"7a7d2848-643f-431d-affc-2846c3e4d6f1","timestamp":"2026-09-04T03:43:37.624Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Verify chacha20poly1305 aead/secretbox"}
